For this problem it was asked to make a Black Friday shopping application using Composite and Observer.
Composite because the idea was to organize products into categories, and categories could also have other categories inside them.
Observer because it was asked to notify customers whenever there was a new deal and whenever we hear like notifications its almost always observer.
I used BlackFridayDeals to store the subscribed customers in a list and notify them using a for loop.
In the Main I created V, JK, and Jimin, but only V and JK subscribed, so Jimin doesn't receive notifications.
I used the homework instructions, the slides and the prevuos code weve done in class.